# G2-RERANK-LADDER Tier 3 — bundled Core ML model + tokenizer.
# 531 MB weight blob exceeds GitHub's per-file limit. Each developer
# generates this locally via `scripts/build-bge-reranker.sh`; the
# resulting files land in Kalsmritikosh/Resources/BGEReranker/ and
# Xcode picks them up via PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup at the
# next build. Keep the directory itself ignored so accidental commits
# of the binaries don't poison history.
Kalsmritikosh/Resources/BGEReranker/

# P6.2 — BGE-small embedder Core ML model + vocab. Same rationale as the
# reranker above: the weight blob is large and generated, not committed. Each
# developer runs `scripts/build-bge-embedder.sh` once; output lands here and
# Xcode's PBXFileSystemSynchronizedRootGroup bundles it at the next build.
Kalsmritikosh/Resources/BGESmallEmbedder/
